<title>USA: Oppenheimer Capital ups qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer Capital ups qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.85		     $0.75</p>
<p> Pay	     February 28</p>
<p> Record	   January 31</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Oppenheimer Capital LP</p>
<p>The company also said it declared a special distribution of $0.10 per unit payable on February 28 to holders of record on January 31, as part of net gain on the sale of the investment advisory and other contracts and business relationships of the 12 Quest for Value mutual funds.</p>
</text>
